  "version": "0.5.5-beta.10",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.5-beta.9`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- count a system notification on the app icon only once it is shown, since one the system refused or that failed still added to the badge: a notification whose tab came into sight while it was on its way is not counted either ([c023cfd7](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c023cfd7a2b77ed4904d596be250439e4c64a1bc))\n- tell a copy whose app icon badge is off how to turn it on, since macOS asks for badges only once and a copy that allowed notifications before tTerm asked for badges kept the Dock count hidden with no sign why: Settings > Notifications now says so and points to Badge app icon under System Settings > Notifications > tTerm ([9b5c8e57](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9b5c8e57ca7aaa0e72c77430b8d4d27704db31e0))\n- show the Dock badge on macOS, since the Dock hides an app's badge unless its notification authorization includes badges and tTerm asked only for alerts and sounds: the request now asks for badges too; a copy that was already authorized may need Badge app icon turned on under System Settings > Notifications ([619c8cb8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/619c8cb8482c6b70e2d27927192383b2c64859ce))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.5-beta.9...v0.5.5-beta.10](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.5-beta.9...v0.5.5-beta.10)",
